      "latex": "$\\hat{\\mathbf{x}} = \\mathbf{W}_d \\mathrm{ReLU}(\\mathbf{W}_e \\mathbf{x} + \\mathbf{b}_e)$",
      "filename": "beat3_architecture.svg",
